{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12232050","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12232050","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1223205001:1":{"text":"可恶，你们居然帮水鬼欺负我，我要告诉所有人！","source_cn":"可恶，你们居然帮水鬼欺负我，我要告诉所有人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAA5014388CEAEBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1223205002:1":{"text":"别颠倒是非，既然他给你干了活，不管怎样，你要付干活的钱。","source_cn":"别颠倒是非，既然他给你干了活，不管怎样，你要付干活的钱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32860A47718028B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1223205003:1":{"text":"至于之前的恩怨，那是另一回事。","source_cn":"至于之前的恩怨，那是另一回事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9CBC5F02E588710","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1223205004:1":{"text":"没错，满满最讨厌公报私仇。一码归一码，才是骑士的美德！","source_cn":"没错，满满最讨厌公报私仇。一码归一码，才是骑士的美德！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFE282C7121E8011","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1223205005:1":{"text":"你要是栽赃陷害，我们就把你送去血薇帮，他们会给恶人公平的审判！","source_cn":"你要是栽赃陷害，我们就把你送去血薇帮，他们会给恶人公平...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38D1B87B057C23E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1223205006:1":{"text":"别！我刚才跟你们开玩笑呢，这是答应给水鬼的钱，啊不，全都给你好了！","source_cn":"别！我刚才跟你们开玩笑呢，这是答应给水鬼的钱，啊不，全...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBA051830823D9A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1223205007:0":{"text":"这、这么多？！","source_cn":"这、这么多？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9D05D36C8C5EF1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1223205008:1":{"text":"梭罗，只拿该拿的那一份。","source_cn":"梭罗，只拿该拿的那一份。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC1CC2168E9C3C71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1223205009:0":{"text":"可、可是……不拿白不拿，水鬼就该连拿带兜，这不是你教我们的吗？","source_cn":"可、可是……不拿白不拿，水鬼就该连拿带兜，这不是你教我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0A4A8138DAE97C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1223205010:1":{"text":"那是做劫匪的时候，和现在能一样吗？","source_cn":"那是做劫匪的时候，和现在能一样吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB477C7E4E2992C89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1223205011:1":{"text":"行吧，听你的，为了……新生活！","source_cn":"行吧，听你的，为了……新生活！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEAA5A8A0A5FE3CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1223205012:1":{"text":"喂！拿走你的臭钱！我们现在不是劫匪了！只拿该拿的！","source_cn":"喂！拿走你的臭钱！我们现在不是劫匪了！只拿该拿的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29982563C34EA77D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1223205013:1":{"text":"没想到你们还挺有原则，小看你们了。","source_cn":"没想到你们还挺有原则，小看你们了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74C7C3C4FCD37E18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1223205014:1":{"text":"看什么看，快滚！","source_cn":"看什么看，快滚！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACFE0F4C71136475","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1223205015:1":{"text":"哼，再怎么变，一天是水鬼，一辈子都是水鬼，认命吧！","source_cn":"哼，再怎么变，一天是水鬼，一辈子都是水鬼，认命吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x399451B41BB69DE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1223205016:1":{"text":"真烦！一个两个的，都朝老子吐口水，什么时候是个头？","source_cn":"真烦！一个两个的，都朝老子吐口水，什么时候是个头？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4112795DCA7A71C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1223205017:1":{"text":"耐心一点，海上的太阳总会升起。咱们最擅长的，不就是等太阳出来？","source_cn":"耐心一点，海上的太阳总会升起。咱们最擅长的，不就是等太...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41714B7D1AC3874B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1223205018:1":{"text":"对了，西索呢，不是和你在一起吗？","source_cn":"对了，西索呢，不是和你在一起吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22656DA0766FA5F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1223205019:1":{"text":"他去另外一条街找活了，这么久不回来，八成也碰到挑事情的了。","source_cn":"他去另外一条街找活了，这么久不回来，八成也碰到挑事情的了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E3B5848501C3E9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1223205020:1":{"text":"去看看他，你带路。","source_cn":"去看看他，你带路。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C0BB5954327A056","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蛮横的混混":{"text":"蛮横的混混","source":"蛮横的混混","status":"source"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"漫漫","source":"漫漫","status":"source"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"满满","source":"满满","status":"source"},"speaker:水鬼帮梭罗":{"text":"水鬼帮梭罗","source":"水鬼帮梭罗","status":"source"},"speaker:水鬼帮阿尔":{"text":"水鬼帮阿尔","source":"水鬼帮阿尔","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":21,"localized_text_count":20,"speaker_count":5}}